#: manual/contribute/index.md:10
msgid "[Code standard](code_standard.md): rules for the mods' code, such as keeping nothing of the store after leaving it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/contribute/index.md:11
msgid "[Modding tools](modding_tools.md): building mods, the scanner check, the game-inspection tools and the Leak Probe."
